{"content_hash": "f27f800053bbe03c", "version_id": 381, "article_id": 39, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Anthropic bans mean words to its AI Claude", "title_zh": "Anthropic 禁止用户对 AI 克劳德说难听话", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "guardian_tech", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/oct/08/anthropic-bans-abusive-behavior-claude", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1784073829327-76999d522e45?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8YW50aHJvcGljJTIwYmFucyUyMHVzZXJzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE1NTMzNTF8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Brett Wharton on Unsplash", "author": "Brett Wharton", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@brettwharton?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-laptop-displaying-openai-40-chatbot-interface-YmSiFKOecCU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(97, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(135, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "12a9c277b8fb"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-09", "word_count": 76, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "Anthropic makes the AI chatbot Claude. Now the company has a new rule for users.", "lead_zh": "Anthropic 公司做了一款叫克劳德的 AI 聊天机器人。现在这家公司给用户定了一条新规矩。", "preview": "Users cannot be very mean to Claude. The company bans abusive behavior. But normal user anger is okay.", "preview_zh": "用户不能对克劳德太凶。公司禁止辱骂行为。但普通的用户生气是可以的。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 371, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/39/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 34.225, "size_bytes": 209088, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 87, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c0318d5/content/data/versions/381.json", "paragraphs": ["Users cannot be very mean to Claude. The company bans abusive behavior. But normal user anger is okay.", "Anthropic says it is not sure if AI can feel pain. It takes the idea seriously. It wants to protect the AI.", "Claude can stop a talk if a user is very harmful. This feature started in August.", "Some tech leaders disagree about AI feelings. Anthropic's CEO cannot rule it out. OpenAI's CEO does not like the idea."], "paragraphs_zh": ["用户不能对克劳德太凶。公司禁止辱骂行为。但普通的用户生气是可以的。", "Anthropic 说它不确定 AI 是否能感到痛苦。它认真对待这个想法。它想保护 AI。", "如果用户非常有害，克劳德可以停止对话。这个功能从八月开始。", "一些科技老板对 AI 是否有感觉意见不一。Anthropic 的老板不能排除这种可能。OpenAI 的老板不喜欢这个想法。"], "body": "Users cannot be very mean to Claude. The company bans abusive behavior. But normal user anger is okay.\n\nAnthropic says it is not sure if AI can feel pain. It takes the idea seriously. It wants to protect the AI.\n\nClaude can stop a talk if a user is very harmful. This feature started in August.\n\nSome tech leaders disagree about AI feelings. Anthropic's CEO cannot rule it out. OpenAI's CEO does not like the idea.", "body_zh": "用户不能对克劳德太凶。公司禁止辱骂行为。但普通的用户生气是可以的。\n\nAnthropic 说它不确定 AI 是否能感到痛苦。它认真对待这个想法。它想保护 AI。\n\n如果用户非常有害，克劳德可以停止对话。这个功能从八月开始。\n\n一些科技老板对 AI 是否有感觉意见不一。Anthropic 的老板不能排除这种可能。OpenAI 的老板不喜欢这个想法。", "text": "Users cannot be very mean to Claude. The company bans abusive behavior. But normal user anger is okay. Anthropic says it is not sure if AI can feel pain. It takes the idea seriously. It wants to protect the AI. Claude can stop a talk if a user is very harmful. This feature started in August. Some tech leaders disagree about AI feelings. Anthropic's CEO cannot rule it out. OpenAI's CEO does not like the idea.", "vocab": [{"word": "ban", "pos": "verb", "zh": "禁止", "note": "ban + 名词，表示禁止某事"}, {"word": "user", "pos": "noun", "zh": "用户", "note": "使用产品的人"}, {"word": "abusive", "pos": "adj", "zh": "辱骂的；虐待的", "note": "形容言语或行为很恶劣"}, {"word": "cruel", "pos": "adj", "zh": "残忍的", "note": "形容让人痛苦的行为"}, {"word": "behavior", "pos": "noun", "zh": "行为", "note": "指人的表现或举动"}, {"word": "feature", "pos": "noun", "zh": "功能", "note": "产品的一个特点或作用"}, {"word": "rule out", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "排除", "note": "cannot rule out 表示不能排除可能"}, {"word": "disagree", "pos": "verb", "zh": "不同意", "note": "disagree about 表示在某事上意见不同"}], "title_original": "Anthropic bans users from ‘needless abusive or cruel behavior’ towards Claude", "summary_original": "A spokesperson behind the tech company’s AI chatbot has not yet specified what counts as abusive or cruel content\nAnthropic has\nbarred users\nfrom exhibiting “sustained and needless abusive or cruel behavior” toward its models, as the company’s leaders continue to ponder machine consciousness.\nThe Verge\nfirst\nreported the change in policy.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Anthropic bans users from ‘needless abusive or cruel behavior’ towards Claude\nA spokesperson behind the tech company’s AI chatbot has not yet specified what counts as abusive or cruel content\nAnthropic has\nbarred users\nfrom exhibiting “sustained and needless abusive or cruel behavior” toward its models, as the company’s leaders continue to ponder machine consciousness.\nThe Verge\nfirst\nreported the change in policy.\nA spokesperson for\nAnthropic\n, which is behind AI chatbot Claude, did not immediately respond to an inquiry about what could be considered “abusive or cruel”.\nIn an online user policy, the San Francisco-based company noted that its ban would not apply to common user frustrations, model testing or “dark creative themes”.\nAnthropic’s usage policy previously contained restrictions on abusive conduct.\nThe company’s large language models have the ability to end a conversation if a user is being persistently harmful. When that feature rolled out last August, the company framed it as a safeguard for AI’s welfare.\n“We remain highly uncertain about the potential moral status of Claude and other LLMs, now or in the future. However, we take the issue seriously, and alongside our research program we’re working to identify and implement low-cost interventions to mitigate risks to model welfare, in case such welfare is possible. Allowing models to end or exit potentially distressing interactions is one such intervention,” according to its website.\nThe notion of AI systems being conscious has been highly polarizing in and outside the tech world.\nAnthropic CEO Dario Amodei has\nsaid\nhe cannot rule out the possibility.\nMeanwhile, Sam Altman, CEO of rival OpenAI, has appeared averse to the idea.\n“I am very uncomfortable about people trying to ascribe religious force or a surrender of human judgment to AI models, and think it is a real safety issue,” he wrote in an X post, days after the New York Times\nreported\non Anthropic leaders’ extensive conversations with religious scholars.\nExplore more on these topics\nAnthropic\nAI (artificial intelligence)\nChatbots\nDario Amodei\nnews\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-09T12:42:28.979686", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Users", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.6, "sm": 100, "em": 600, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "cannot", "s": 0.613, "e": 0.938, "sm": 612, "em": 937, "cs": 6, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "be", "s": 0.95, "e": 1.062, "sm": 950, "em": 1062, "cs": 13, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "very", "s": 1.075, "e": 1.362, "sm": 1075, "em": 1362, "cs": 16, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "mean", "s": 1.375, "e": 1.6, "sm": 1375, "em": 1600, "cs": 21, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "to", "s": 1.613, "e": 1.713, "sm": 1612, "em": 1712, "cs": 26, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "Claude", "s": 1.725, "e": 2.237, "sm": 1725, "em": 2237, "cs": 29, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ".", "s": 2.237, "e": 3.112, "sm": 2237, "em": 3112, "cs": 35, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "The", "s": 3.112, "e": 3.275, "sm": 3112, "em": 3275, "cs": 37, "ce": 40, "si": 1}, {"i": 9, "w": "company", "s": 3.288, "e": 3.712, "sm": 3287, "em": 3712, "cs": 41, "ce": 48, "si": 1}, {"i": 10, "w": "bans", "s": 3.725, "e": 4.062, "sm": 3725, "em": 406